#: scenario8:scenario8_FE467025_F607_4DFF_AAAB_8B2043B0BA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22f879869af020f97291ebea4e1e8243a73bb406e6c84a58e4fa2b6c90e7e210
