msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nevertheless, his cooperation will undoubtedly be the easiest of the three to "
"gain. ⟪k:3⟫We were fortunate to run into him first."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ainda assim, dos três, sua cooperação será, sem dúvida, a mais fácil de ganhar. "
"⟪k:3⟫Tivemos sorte de nos deparar com ele primeiro."

